    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-15-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The act and the harm are temporally related.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relationship between the act and the harm.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Between",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; (b) the act or omission breaches a condition of a consent; (c) the act or omission has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-15-ss-2-logic-argumentation-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If the breach occurs, then the offence is committed.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implication of breach on offence commitment.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; (b) the act or omission breaches a condition of a consent; (c) the act or omission has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-15-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A person commits an offence if they breach a condition of consent.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to not breach a condition of consent.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; (b) the act or omission breaches a condition of a consent; (c) the act or omission has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-15-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Breaching a condition of consent is prohibited.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on breaching a condition of consent.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; (b) the act or omission breaches a condition of a consent; (c) the act or omission has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-15-ss-2-logic-diffusion-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The effect of the breach propagates.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Propagating the effect of the breach.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Propagation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; (b) the act or omission breaches a condition of a consent; (c) the act or omission has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
