        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2C) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person imports therapeutic goods into Australia; and (b) the goods are exempt under section 18A; and (c) the importation breaches a condition of the exemption."
    },
