    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.17",
      "skos:note": "Accessory means a thing specifically intended to be used with the device. Defines terms used in the Act State or Territory must issue search warrants. Definition of 'private hospital' Goods that have a tradition of use as foods for humans in the form in which they are presented, or goods covered by a determination under subsection 7AA(1) or (2), must be used, advertised, or presented for supply in the way specified in the determination.",
      "skos:prefLabel": {
