      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ag-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "is not admissible in evidence in: (e) proceedings for a pecuniary penalty order against the individual for a contravention of a civil penalty provision.",
