      },
      "cml:operator": "Temporal Interval",
      "cml:premiseText": "Before regulations are made prescribing an international agreement for the purposes of subsection (1), the Minister must be satisfied that the agreement requires parties to the agreement to take steps to prohibit or restrict one or more of the import, export, manufacture and supply of certain goods."
